  "description": "500W Brushless Motor\n\nPowered by a 500W brushless motor, the Lankeleisi G660 delivers robust, efficient performance, effortlessly handling 30° climbs and navigating city streets with ease. Its brushless technology minimizes friction and wear, providing a quieter and longer-lasting riding experience.\n\n48V 12.8Ah Lithium Battery\n\nThe Lankeleisi G660 comes with a removable 48V 12.8Ah lithium-ion battery using durable 18650 cells. It provides up to 45 km in full electric mode and up to 110 km with pedal assist, making it ideal for everyday urban commuting. With its waterproof and dustproof design, the battery delivers reliable performance even in rainy or dusty conditions.\n\nFront Fork Suspension\n\nThe Lankeleisi G660 is equipped with an adjustable aluminum front fork that cushions shocks and vibrations from uneven city streets, providing a smoother and more comfortable ride. Its versatile suspension can be tailored to different terrains, enhancing both comfort and handling.\n\nLCD Color Display\n\nColour Backlight Display to keep track of speed, mileage, power and more.",
